<title>NORWAY: Norway's Nov CPI flat, up 1.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Norway's Nov CPI flat, up 1.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWAY CONSUMER PRICES    NOV 1996   OCT 1996    NOV 1995</p>
<p>Figures (in percent)</p>
<p>  Month-on-month change    0.0	  +0.4	   -0.1</p>
<p>  Year-on-year change     +1.8	  +1.7	   +2.1</p>
<p>  Index (base 1979)	265.9	 265.9	  261.2</p>
<p>NOTE -- Economists forecast a year-on-year rise in November of 1.8 percent and for inflation to be unchanged month-on-month from October.</p>
</text>
